    "html": "<p>The energy of the nth level of hydrogen is given by <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"-\\frac{E_{0}}{n^{2}}\"></span>. What is the frequency of the photon emitted in the transition from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=4\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"n=2\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{16}\\times \\frac{E_{0}}{h}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{16}\\times \\frac{E_{0}}{h}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{4}\\times \\frac{E_{0}}{h}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{3}{4}\\times \\frac{E_{0}}{h}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
